{"id":138627793,"slug":"the-complex-case-psychiatrist","title":"The Complex Case Psychiatrist","subtitle":"An interview from 2015 with Dr. Sam Sharmat","post_date":"2023-11-06T11:35:46.986Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/the-complex-case-psychiatrist","wordcount":69,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:56:16.813Z","body_sha256":"eb112aad9176b365407bf16b22d7bef86a6741f8fa84b354dec9c68f9288ed5a","text_words":75,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>This is an interview from 2015 with Samuel Sharmat, M.D., a brilliant diagnostician.  It also was an interview that, in retrospect, helped define my options as a physician.  He has a traumatic brain injury as a young child, it changed him.  For him, the change unlocked new ways to notice what might be wrong with patients in ways that others could not.   Please listen, and share with your friends.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HPjL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F35c02a49-b2ed-42e7-b099-e60fdff3c7b0_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HPjL!,w_424,c_lim